      "Launch headless /usr/bin/chromium through HTTPS_PROXY with Playwright.",
      "For every route, create 3 independent contexts using the recorded viewport/mobile settings and locale de-DE.",
      "Enable CDP Network, Network.setCacheDisabled(cacheDisabled=true), Network.emulateNetworkConditions with the recorded byte rates and latency, and Emulation.setCPUThrottlingRate(rate=4).",
      "Before navigation inject buffered PerformanceObservers for largest-contentful-paint, layout-shift (excluding hadRecentInput) and longtask. Navigate with wait_until=load, then observe another 5000 ms without interaction.",
      "Read navigation/paint entries, calculate maximum CLS session window and median of three LCP/CLS values.",
      "Separately navigate each route with java_script_enabled=false and collect visible H1, main text, canonical URL and contact links; compare the server response markup and hydrated H1."
